---
/** 모든 페이지 공통 틀: 배경·폭·글꼴·헤더·푸터. 페이지 내용은 섹션 컴포넌트로 slot에 넣는다. */
import { ClientRouter } from 'astro:transitions';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import Footer from '../components/sections/Footer.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

interface Props {
  title?: string;
  description?: string;
  /** 헤더에 "← 전체" 링크를 붙인다(상세 페이지) */
  back?: boolean;
}

const { title = site.title, description = site.description, back = false } = Astro.props;
const canonical = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site);
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <link rel="sitemap" href="/sitemap-index.xml" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <!-- 홈: IBM Plex Sans KR · Geist Mono · Gowun Dodum. 목업: Noto Sans KR(시스템 글꼴 대체), Jua(퀴즈), Outfit·Inter(HomeTender·Korea Trip Planner), JetBrains Mono·Pretendard(포모봇) -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Gowun+Dodum&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700;900&family=Jua&family=Outfit:wght@600;700&family=Inter:wght@600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@700&display=swap"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.css" />
    <ClientRouter />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrap">
      <SiteHeader back={back} />
      <main class="content">
        <slot />
      </main>
      <Footer />
    </div>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .wrap {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 40px 80px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 88px;
  }
  .content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 88px; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .wrap { padding: 24px 16px 56px; gap: 64px; }
    .content { gap: 64px; }
  }
</style>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --bg: #111111;
    --fg: #ededed;
    --fg-sub: #a3a3a3;
    --fg-muted: #8f8f8f;
    --line: #2a2a2a;
    --link-underline: #555555;
    --font-sans: 'IBM Plex Sans KR', -apple-system, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', sans-serif;
    --font-mono: 'Geist Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
  }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
  }
  a {
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--link-underline);
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
  a:hover { text-decoration-color: var(--fg); }
</style>
